-- Durotar (zone 14): tie two sets of holiday spawns that stood all year to their events.
--
-- 1) 352 Noblegarden Bunny Waypoints (32782) and Controllers (32784) in Razor Hill had no game_event_creature row,
--    so they stood all year (invisible: flags_extra TRIGGER) and walked their waypoint paths through town.
--    Neither TDB spawns either entry; the Noblegarden eggs and merchants beside them are tied to Noblegarden (event 9).
--    Ours, from mop's own rows: Noblegarden, the event the eggs and merchants beside them use. The spawns, addons and paths are kept as they are.
--    Elsewhere: the same two entries have 2106 more spawns without an event (Stormwind, Silvermoon, Azuremyst, Elwynn,
--    Teldrassil, Loch Modan, Azshara); not changed here (core list).
-- 2) 68 "Firework, Show, ..." objects (180703-180741) hung 125-176 yd above the Dranosh'ar Blockade with no event; the 35
--    other spawns of the same show in zone 14 are tied to Midsummer (event 1). Ours, from mop's own rows: the event of
--    their siblings (TDB 12.1.0 has one Firework, Show object in the box, on Winter Veil; 4.4.2 none).
--    Orgrimmar (zone 1637) has 144 more untied firework objects; not changed here.

